      "text": [
        "Why we ship from the UK, not Seoul",
        "Harrisons Beauty was started after one too many six-week waits (and surprise customs charges) for a bottle of toner. We now hold full stock of every product we sell in our own warehouse, so orders placed before 3pm go out the same day, with no import fees or nasty surprises at the door.",
